      </div>
      <div id="timerBar">⏰ Time Left: <span id="timerText">03:00</span></div>
      <div id="quizArea">
        <form id="quizForm">
          <div class="question"><b>Q1. What does Math.random() return?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q1" value="a"> Random decimal 0 to 0.999...</label><label><input type="radio" name="q1" value="b"> Random whole number 1 to 100</label><label><input type="radio" name="q1" value="c"> Always 0</label><label><input type="radio" name="q1" value="d"> Always 1</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q2. Formula for random index 0 to length-1?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="a"> Math.floor(Math.random() * length)</label><label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="b"> Math.random() * length</label><label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="c"> Math.ceil(Math.random())</label><label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="d"> Math.round(length)</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q3. What does Math.floor(4.9) return?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q3" value="a"> 4</label><label><input type="radio" name="q3" value="b"> 5</label><label><input type="radio" name="q3" value="c"> 4.9</label><label><input type="radio" name="q3" value="d"> 0</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q4. What does "ABC".charAt(1) return?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q4" value="a"> "B"</label><label><input type="radio" name="q4" value="b"> "A"</label><label><input type="radio" name="q4" value="c"> "C"</label><label><input type="radio" name="q4" value="d"> Error</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q5. How to build a 12-length password?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q5" value="a"> Loop 12 times, each time add one random char from pool</label><label><input type="radio" name="q5" value="b"> Pick one char only</label><label><input type="radio" name="q5" value="c"> Copy pool directly</label><label><input type="radio" name="q5" value="d"> Use Math.random() once</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q6. How to copy text to clipboard?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q6" value="a"> navigator.clipboard.writeText(text)</label><label><input type="radio" name="q6" value="b"> document.copy(text)</label><label><input type="radio" name="q6" value="c"> clipboard.copy(text)</label><label><input type="radio" name="q6" value="d"> window.copy(text)</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q7. If no checkbox is ticked, what to do?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q7" value="a"> Show alert - Please tick at least one option</label><label><input type="radio" name="q7" value="b"> Generate empty password</label><label><input type="radio" name="q7" value="c"> Crash page</label><label><input type="radio" name="q7" value="d"> Generate "Error"</label></div>
